    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "The repository runs Statecraft's github-actions-rust profile at revision 13. Revision 28 adds five required jobs (preflight, supply-chain, workflow-lint, sg-scan, secret-scan), a policy-isolation guard, a reviewer guide, a remote desired-state record and a merge-queue rule for post-merge pushes. This spec adopts it in three pull requests: a preparation under revision 13 that declares the queue, gives every extra job the post_merge input and clears the workflow lint; a change that hashes the files the render adds; and the render itself. Spec 191's aggregate of seven jobs and its 15-minute review become twelve jobs and 20 minutes.\n",
